# `helm package` output. The published artefact is the OCI artifact under
# ghcr.io/myne-md/charts (`the operations repository/runbooks/server-kubernetes.md` §3); a .tgz beside the chart
# source is a local build leftover, and committing one would ship a stale copy the registry
# knows nothing about.
deploy/helm/*.tgz

# OS
.DS_Store

# Per-repository worktrees, the convention every repo in this org follows
# (`the agent tooling repository/reference/worktrees.md`). They are working copies, never content.
/.worktrees/
